&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analyst Intern, you&#39;ll spend 12 weeks embedded within a team across our Money and Growth org, getting direct exposure to the metrics, stakeholders, and strategic priorities that drive Robinhood&#39;s core business. You&#39;ll own real work from day one and build the analytical and cross-functional skills that define our team. Top performers may be extended an offer to join our 18-month rotational Business Analyst program after graduation.&lt;/p&gt;
