&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8780&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8812&quot;&gt; Lead and support your team of developers, providing clear goals, regular feedback, and structured growth plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8928&quot;&gt;Technical Strategy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8949&quot;&gt; Define technical direction and prioritize work with product managers and partner teams to scale our international products and systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9089&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9118&quot;&gt; Ensure backend services and localized products are designed for high availability, performance, and security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9232&quot;&gt;Talent Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9252&quot;&gt; Manage hiring, onboarding, and performance evaluations for engineers on your team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9339&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9367&quot;&gt; Coordinate with product, design, and other engineering leads to deliver critical initiatives on schedule and meet defined business metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9511&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9530&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9543&quot;&gt; 5+ years of software engineering experience, including at least 2 years of experience managing engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9661&quot;&gt;Product Shipping Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9691&quot;&gt; Proven experience leading collaborative teams across product, design, and engineering to ship complex products, including end-to-end management from concept to launch, and ensuring high-quality, reliable user experiences post-deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9933&quot;&gt;Systems Design:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;9950&quot;&gt; Experience designing and operating distributed systems with a focus on reliability, scalability, and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10068&quot;&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10087&quot;&gt; Experience delivering complex technical projects from initial planning through execution and deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10196&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10212&quot;&gt; Ability to communicate clearly with both technical and business partners to explain technical decisions and trade-offs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
