&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10336&quot;&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10349&quot;&gt; Experience supporting team development through regular coaching, mentoring, and feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
