&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10743&quot;&gt;Hire and retain top talent by setting a high bar, hiring only those who raise it, investing in onboarding, and addressing talent issues quickly and fairly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
