&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;10900&quot;&gt;Create community by connecting work to purpose, removing friction while prioritizing safety, building trust and inclusion, and leading from the front with integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
