&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Growth Finance team partners with Robinhood’s Growth and Marketing organizations to guide investment decisions and help drive efficient, sustainable customer and asset growth. We provide financial and strategic insights across customer acquisition, marketing, promotions, and product-led growth initiatives, with a focus on growing Net Funded Accounts, Net Deposits, and Gold subscribers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Finance &amp;amp; Strategy Senior Analyst, Growth &amp;amp; Marketing, you will be a key Finance partner to the Growth and Marketing organizations, combining financial modeling, analytics, and business judgment to inform investment decisions. You will independently own high-impact analyses and leadership reporting, while helping modernize and scale Finance processes through automation and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA, New York, NY or Chicago, IL offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own key Growth Finance reporting and performance management processes, delivering clear insights on business performance, trends, risks, and opportunities to Finance and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and scale Finance processes through automation and AI, identifying opportunities to streamline recurring reporting, increase analytical depth, and build more efficient and scalable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth and Marketing partners to evaluate investments across performance marketing, promotions, and product-led growth initiatives, developing clear financial recommendations that inform resource allocation and business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build financial models and analyses that translate ambiguous business questions into structured frameworks, evaluating ROI, payback, customer and asset growth, revenue, and other key financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Data Science, Accounting, Marketing, Product, and other teams to develop data-driven insights, improve measurement, and support strategic Growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–5+ years of experience in strategic finance, FP&amp;amp;A, investment banking, consulting, or a similarly analytical role, with strong financial modeling and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and problem-solving skills, with the ability to take ambiguous questions, identify the key drivers, structure an analytical approach, and develop a clear financial point of view and recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of ownership and independence, with the ability to manage multiple priorities, proactively identify opportunities and risks, and drive work from initial question through final recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and communication skills, with the ability to work with large datasets, synthesize complex analyses into clear insights, and communicate effectively with both technical partners and senior business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first and continuous-improvement mindset, with curiosity about emerging tools and a track record of using technology, automation, or AI to make analytical and reporting processes faster, smarter, and more scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
