&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in a quantitative field such as Finance, Economics, Statistics, or a related discipline with expected graduation date of Winter 2027/Summer 2028&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate data into clear, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL preferred; comfort working with data and a willingness to learn new tools quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity and a proactive mindset — you ask questions, dig into the &#39;why&#39; behind the numbers, and proactively identify what to tackle next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with strong initiative, able to take ownership of tasks and drive them forward with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
