&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot;&gt;Robinhood’s &lt;strong&gt;International Expansion&lt;/strong&gt; team builds and scales customer-facing experiences for international markets across iOS, Android, web, and backend. The team is product-agnostic and helps bring Robinhood’s Brokerage, Money, and Crypto products to new markets, partnering closely on onboarding flows, QA, launch readiness, and region-specific execution.&lt;/p&gt;
