&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1964&quot;&gt;Build intuitive, elegant, and stable mobile experiences using Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and modern Android APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1967&quot; data-end=&quot;2089&quot;&gt;Lead the full lifecycle of product features — from ideation and technical design to implementation, testing, and release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2216&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Managers, Designers, Backend Engineers, and Data Scientists to create impactful solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2219&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;Champion engineering best practices that ensure code quality, scalability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
