&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7081&quot;&gt;Identify and implement improvements to system performance, engineering productivity, and risk reduction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7187&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with client teams, product managers, designers, and external vendors to deliver reliable technical solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
