&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;634&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;658&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;Prime team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;&#39;s mission is to build Bitstamp&#39;s prime brokerage for institutional clients — the platform that lets hedge funds, market makers, and professional trading firms onboard, fund, trade, borrow against, and settle positions at scale. We build the systems that move real institutional money: cross-venue settlement, credit against collateral, matched-book lending, and the bridge that brings tokenized securities to our order book — together with the client- and ops-facing surfaces that make them usable, from institutional onboarding and account configuration to reporting and the backoffice tooling our operations run on every day. These are correctness-critical systems where a wrong answer can&#39;t be cheaply undone — getting them right is the whole job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;As a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1917&quot;&gt; you will own the design and end-to-end delivery of features across that whole surface — from the Prime backend services down to the frontend and backoffice screens that expose them. You&#39;ll lead other engineers through problems of high ambiguity, set the technical bar for how we build for failure and not just the happy path, and follow a problem across the full institutional lifecycle rather than stopping at a boundary. Flexibility is the job: some weeks that&#39;s a settlement edge case in the backend, others a client onboarding flow or an ops dashboard, and you&#39;re happy owning whichever the work needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;This role is based in our London office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2860&quot;&gt;Requires participation in an on-call rotation to support business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2960&quot;&gt;Lead the design and end-to-end delivery of features across the stack — from Prime backend services (settlement, on-exchange credit, lending, tokenized securities) through to the frontend and backoffice screens clients and ops teams rely on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3202&quot;&gt;Own the client- and ops-facing journeys across the institutional lifecycle — onboarding, account configuration, reporting, and the tooling that lets operations run the business safely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3388&quot;&gt;Author detailed designs and break work into reviewable steps, making failure states, invariants, and recovery explicit before you ship — on flows where a wrong answer moves real money.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3574&quot;&gt;Uplevel the team through design-focused code review and mentorship, and move fluidly between backend and frontend as the work demands rather than handing off at a boundary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3753&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3772&quot;&gt;A track record of independently delivering complex, high-ambiguity projects with long-term impact, operating them in production and owning every line you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3933&quot;&gt;Strong full-stack range in production — a modern backend (we work primarily in Python/Django and Go) and a component-based frontend (we use Vue) — with the judgment to know where a given problem is best solved and a genuine willingness to own whatever the feature needs, wherever it lives in the stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4237&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building financial systems — user balances, ledgers, risk engines, settlement, onboarding/KYC, or payments — where correctness is non-negotiable and mistakes are expensive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
