&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Robinhood is looking for a skilled Tax Operations Analyst to join our team! We are seeking driven individuals who thrive in a fast-paced environment and can manage multiple priorities. In this role, you will work on executing various exception reports covering areas such as reporting, withholding, and cost basis. You will also help our Customer Experience and Account Operations teams handle tax-related inquiries and resolve reporting issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
