&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;Develop and assist with the implementation of reconciliations of data between internal systems and vendors, as well as verification of data being sent from the tax reporting vendor to IRS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
