&lt;p&gt;As a Special Projects Intern, you&#39;ll be embedded in a fast-paced, high-visibility environment where no two days look the same. You&#39;ll contribute directly to strategic initiatives across the company, working alongside PM leaders, researchers, engineers, and finance partners. You&#39;ll be expected to bring your full skill set to every project — whether that means synthesizing data, coordinating across stakeholders, or building something from scratch. This role rewards people who are adaptable, curious, and ready to make a real contribution from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
