&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Performance-driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/li&gt;
